IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cosa vedo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
