EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
You are committed to cleanliness!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}But it's funny how we create more
