devenait le bazar chez toi ? Ha ha !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehi! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
